  "answer_text": "The term **\"Chase Capital Services\"** most commonly refers to the legal vehicle leasing arm of **JPMorgan Chase Bank** in the United States. However, depending on your context, it can also refer to a private financial advisory firm in India or other similarly named entities. \n\n---\n\n### 1. Chase Auto / Car Leasing (United States)\nIf you leased a vehicle (particularly through manufacturers partnered with Chase, such as **Mazda**, **Subaru**, **Jaguar**, **Land Rover**, or **Tesla**), **\"Chase Capital Services\"** or **\"JPMorgan Chase Bank, N.A.\"** will be listed as the owner/lessor on your car\u2019s state title and registration documents. \n\nIf you are looking to buy out your lease, transfer your registration to another state, or resolve a title/lien issue, you will need to coordinate with Chase Auto:\n\n* **Lease Customer Service Phone:** 1-800-227-5151\n* **Lease Lienholder Titling Address:** \n  > PO Box 901098  \n  > Fort Worth, TX 76101\n* **Standard Lease Payments Mailing Address:** \n  > Chase Auto  \n  > P.O. Box 650546  \n  > Dallas, TX 75265\n* **Overnight / Express Lease Payoffs Address:** \n  > JPMorgan Chase (TX1-0029)  \n  > Chase Auto Lease Payments Box 650546  \n  > 14800 Frye Road  \n  > Fort Worth, TX 76155\n\n---\n\n### 2. Chase Capital Services Private Limited (India)\nThis is an independent, active financial services and consultancy firm in India. It is **not** associated with JPMorgan Chase Bank.\n* **Founded:** 1997\n* **Headquarters:** Chandigarh / Mohali, India\n* **Services:** Corporate advisory, debt syndication, securitization services, currency and commodities trading, and IPO advisory.\n* **Website:** `chasecapital.co.in` (and registered as *Chase Capital Services Private Limited* under India's Ministry of Corporate Affairs).\n\n---\n\n### 3. Other Entities to Note\n* **Chase Capital Holdings LLC (USA):** An Atlanta, Georgia-based private hard money lender that has been providing short- and long-term financing to residential real estate investors for over two decades. \n* **Chase Capital (Canada):** A private capital platform and advisory firm that helps unique mid-market businesses grow across Canada.\n* **\"Chase Capital Online\" (FCA Warning):** If you are looking at an online trading or investment platform by this name, be aware that the UK's Financial Conduct Authority (FCA) has issued an official warning against *Chase Capital Online* (`chasecapitalonline.com`), flagging it as an unauthorized clone firm operating illegally.",
